     +8 public-bindings   eight module-scope `सार्वजनिक चरः` — the two name
                          counts behind exit ४, and `वस्तुरचनाविरामभेद` with its
                          five constants. NOTHING is subtracted here, which is
                          what proves the eight are the whole of the addition.
     +7 bindings / चरः    those eight MINUS the deleted local `चरः नामपूर्वम्`.
                          The one-place gap against `public-bindings` IS that
                          local, and it is the reason this row exists: it read
                          the name cursor so the pass could subtract, and the
