                          reporting −३९ entries written for `vastu.t1`.
     +6 assignments       seven added (five exits, two counts) minus the removed
                          `सङ्कलनविरामभेद भवति सङ्कलनावृत्तिभेद`, which went with
                          the routine guard.
     +1 यदि               the object builder's instruction guard NARROWED from
                          one test to three nested (+2), less the removed
                          routine guard `यदि वृत्तयः समम् ०` (−1).
     −1 प्रत्यागमनम्       that routine guard's early return. A guard that
                          deferred a capability rather than preventing a defect.

   NOT A MEMBER, AND NAMED BECAUSE AN EARLIER MARGIN GOT THIS WRONG:
   `सङ्कलनगणनाभङ्गभेद`, a sign-guard exit, was added and withdrawn INSIDE the
   branch. Against main it is net zero and is nobody's −1. Two margins attributed
   a −1 to it before `public-bindings` moving +8 with no subtraction showed the
   addition was undiminished. **A delta is only checkable against a key that
   cannot absorb the error**, and that is this block's whole purpose.

   2026-09-07, THE OBJECT BUILDER MERGED WITH agent/index AND agent/storeprobe.
   THE SUPERSEDED READING IS THE ONE ABOVE, and it was correct for a tree that
