   NOT ATTRIBUTED TO THIS ROW. Three `.t1` sources moved on main between this
   branch's gate and its merge — `ir.t1`, `utsarjana.t1`, `yantrotsarjana.t1` —
   so these figures carry three lanes' growth and no single delta here is
   readable as one row's contribution. `अन्यथा` moved for the first time in
