   THE SAME DELTA ARRIVING ON A DIFFERENT BASE IS WHAT INDEPENDENCE LOOKS LIKE
   FROM A CENSUS. The driver's contribution does not depend on what else the
   tree holds, and a figure landing differently here would have been a finding
   about the interaction rather than a number to type.

   `यावत्` MOVED, 314 -> 315, and the one loop is `नामसञ्चयः` walking a
