     CENSUS keyword-alternatives = 32
     CENSUS keyword-written = 15

   SUPERSEDED 2026-09-06 (`W-kosha` phase 2) — चरः/bindings 3113, भवति 5098,
   यदि 1992, अन्यथा 126, यावत् 313, प्रत्यागमनम् 1804, assignments 1985,
