   module can be written whole without the grammar gaining a word.

   SUPERSEDED 2026-09-06 (`W-254`) — चरः/bindings 3071, भवति 5024, यदि 1976,
   अन्यथा 125, यावत् 306, प्रत्यागमनम् 1797, assignments 1953,
   public-bindings 533 — RE-TAKEN FROM THE GATE'S OWN FAILURE and not computed.
   The corpus moved because `W-254` lowered a string literal: `ir.t1` gained the
   उक्त arm and three routines, `yantrotsarjana.t1` gained `यन्त्रपाठावतरणम्`
   and the string pool's section. `keyword-alternatives` and `keyword-written`
   are UNMOVED at 32 and 15, which is the half of this block that says the row
