   those would be a language change wearing a lowering's clothes.

   SUPERSEDED 2026-09-05 (`W-265`) — चरः/bindings 3014, भवति 4939, यदि 1952,
   अन्यथा 124, यावत् 301, प्रत्यागमनम् 1773, assignments 1925,
   public-bindings 517 — RE-TAKEN FROM THE GATE'S OWN FAILURE and not computed.
   `artha.त१` gained a type-name table and the routines that read and write it,
